            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">What protein powder has the most protein per scoop?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Among mainstream powders, Optimum Nutrition Platinum Hydrowhey lists about 30 g per scoop and Transparent Labs Grass-Fed Isolate about 28 g, per the labels at the time of writing. Remember that per-scoop numbers depend on scoop size, so check protein by weight before assuming either is denser than a 25 g isolate with a smaller scoop.
