            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">What protein powder has the most protein per calorie?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Unflavored and lightly flavored whey isolates lead. Isopure Zero Carb lists about 25 g of protein for roughly 100 calories, and NOW Sports Whey Isolate about 24 to 25 g for roughly 110, per the label. Because labels round, anything above about 90 percent of calories from protein is effectively pure protein.
